kzij de watergekoelde zaagfunctie worden tegels strak en stofarm gezaagd. De machine is eenvoudig te bedienen en daardoor geschikt voor zowel doe-het-zelf projecten als professioneel tegelwerk.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"378\"><strong data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"378\">Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"394\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"407\">⭐ Voordelen</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"599\">• Compacte en stabiele tegelzaagmachine<br data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"451\">• Watergekoeld zaagsysteem voor nauwkeurige sneden<br data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"504\">• Geschikt voor keramische wand- en vloertegels<br data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"554\">• Eenvoudig te bedienen en te transporteren</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"617\">📋 Specificaties</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"897\"><strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"628\">Type:</strong> Tegelzaagmachine<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"666\">Motorvermogen:</strong> 550 W<br data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"697\">Zaagblad diameter:</strong> 180 mm<br data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"707\"><strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"731\">Maximale zaaglengte:</strong> ca. 330 mm<br data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"745\"><strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"769\">Maximale zaagdiepte:</strong> ca. 35 mm<br data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"782\"><strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"794\">Koeling:</strong> Waterkoeling<br data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"810\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"825\">Toepassing:</strong> Zagen van keramische wand- en vloertegels<br data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"870\"><strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"880\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"913\">📦 Meegeleverd</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"959\">Tegelzaagmachine<br data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\">Waterreservoir<br data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"951\">Zaagblad</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"979\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1013\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
